dist
# One package manager for this repo, and it is npm: the keeper workflow runs
# npm ci, and app/ was already npm only. A second lockfile is how the two drift
# apart. Dependencies were once added with yarn, which updated yarn.lock and
# left package-lock.json untouched, and npm ci then failed in CI on a lockfile
# that had never heard of @solana/spl-token. Ignored so it cannot come back.
yarn.lock
